# Lesson 5.2 example: communicate a result with service outputs

# The packet contains destinations for the outbound service calls.
Load docs/course/05-real-programs/examples/02_notification_packet.txt as Document

Find review mailbox and save as review_mailbox
Find claims queue and save as claims_queue

# Service calls are effects supplied by the host runtime.
Send Email via NotificationService to review_mailbox with template "review_complete"
Send Message via MessagingService to claims_queue with template "review_complete"
